== Ingredients ==

Gather the following ingredients: @sirloin steak{3/10%lb}, @gluten-free linguine{12/5%oz} (dry), @butter{4/5%tbsp}, @garlic cloves{6/5} (minced), @Parmesan{1/10%cup} (grated), @gluten-free beef broth{1/10%cup}, @reserved gluten-free pasta water{1/10%cup}, @olive oil{1/5%tbsp}, @smoked paprika{1/5%tsp}, @black pepper{1/10%tsp}, @parsley{2/5%tbsp} (chopped), @lemon juice{1/5%tbsp}, @Salt{} (to taste).

== Preparation ==

Cook the gluten-free linguine according to its package and reserve cooking water. Sear the steak in olive oil, rest and slice it. Gently cook garlic in butter, add broth, then toss with pasta, Parmesan and enough reserved water to loosen the sauce. Finish with steak, parsley and lemon.
